 The two Iris patches carried here rework GPL-2.0 kernel code
 (drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/), so they are GPL-2.0 even though the
 driver itself is not. They originate from strongtz/libva-v4l2 (Radxa,
 Xilin Wu) and travel rebased.
 .
 On Debian systems the full text of the GNU General Public License version 2
 can be found in /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-2.

